405 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 177 0 R
/E (AI TOOLS WERE USED THROUGHOUT THE DEVELOPMENT OF THIS PROJECT TO ASSIST WITH SEVERAL TASKS. THESE INCLUDED IMPLEMENTING COLLISION DETECTION AND PHYSICS, HELPING WITH CODE REFACTORING, AND SUPPORTING THE DEPLOYMENT PROCESS USING GITHUB PAGES.)
/Pg 26 0 R
/K [1]
>>
endobj
406 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 177 0 R
/E (THEY WERE ALSO USEFUL FOR UNDERSTANDING AND IMPLEMENTING SPRITE SHEET ANIMATIONS WITHOUT RELYING ON A GAME ENGINE, PARTICULARLY IN MANAGING FRAME-BASED ANIMATION.)
/Pg 26 0 R
/K [2]
>>
endobj
407 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 177 0 R
/E (IN THE EARLY JAVASCRIPT VERSION, AI WAS USED LESS FREQUENTLY, BUT AS THE PROJECT GREW, IT HELPED ADDRESS INCREASING ARCHITECTURAL COMPLEXITY AND MAINTENANCE ISSUES.)
/Pg 26 0 R
/K [3]
>>
endobj
408 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 177 0 R
